click humor pulmones needed
click die needed
click humor paunch needed
click die needed
hold 1
click continue
wait turn 900
skip-unless dice 10
click humor hepar needed
click die needed
click humor spleen needed
click die needed
click humor pulmones needed
click die needed
click humor paunch needed
click die needed
hold 1
click continue
wait turn 900
click skill Short Sword
click skill Snap Thrust
click fighter enemy
cursor rest
hold 3
dice
click humor hepar needed
click die needed
click humor spleen needed
click die needed
click humor pulmones needed
click die needed
click humor paunch needed
click die needed
hold 2
click continue
cursor rest
hold 2
click end-turn
wait 900

