# The wolf is dead; the journey goes on by itself.
clip end fight_2

# ── The city: buy boots ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The visit opens in the Cobbler's Shop (--start-area), on the cobbler (--observe-only). Provisioning
# is a will to buy: one way, carried out by itself. The cobbler's shelf is seeded by his id and lists
# Leather Boots first, at twenty copper.
mark city
clip city_arrival
advance 12 900
cursor rest
hold 6
clip end city_arrival

mark buy_boots
clip buy_boots
click keyword @cobbler
choose 0
hold 2
choose provisioning
advance 12 900
cursor rest
hold 4
click action 0
choose 0
advance 12 900
dice
hold 2
click humor hepar needed
click die needed
click humor spleen needed
click die needed
click humor pulmones needed
click die needed
click humor paunch needed
click die needed
click humor hepar needed
click die needed
hold 2
click continue
advance 20 900
cursor rest
hold 4
click option 0 needed
advance 12 900
hold 2
click option 0 needed
advance 12 900
hold 2
click option 0 needed
advance 12 900
hold 2
click option 0 needed
advance 12 900
dice
hold 2
click humor hepar needed
click die needed
click humor spleen needed
click die needed
click humor pulmones needed
click die needed
click humor paunch needed
click die needed
click humor hepar needed
click die needed
hold 2
click continue
advance 20 900
cursor rest
hold 4
click button
wait mode Trading 900
clip end buy_boots

# ── The trade menu ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
mark trade
clip trade
cursor rest
hold 6
click element trade:plus:0
hold 3
click element trade:confirm
wait mode LocationInteraction 900
cursor rest
hold 3
clip end trade

# ── Wear the boots ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# A bought garment goes straight to its place when that place is free: the boots are on the feet
# already. The inventory shows them there, and the purse empty.
mark wear_boots
clip wear_boots
pause
wait 900
click menu Protagonist
wait 900
click tab inventory
wait 900
cursor rest
hold 4
click element leather_boots
wait 900
cursor rest
hold 6
clip end wear_boots

# ── No coins left: the routine that brings us back ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Each place visited is a mental map; the farm's holds the Work routine learned with the job.
mark routines
clip chorography
click tab chorography
wait 900
cursor rest
hold 5
click element place:farm
wait 900
cursor rest
hold 4
click element routine-next
wait 900
cursor rest
hold 6
clip end chorography

click back
wait 900
click menu Continue
wait 900
advance 12 900
click button
wait mode WorldView 900

# From the world map, the farm's routines are one click from the travel plan.
clip routine_box
travel 7011
wait 900
cursor rest
hold 3
click element travel-routines-button
wait 900
cursor rest
hold 4
click element routines-next
wait 900
cursor rest
hold 6
click element routines-return
wait 900
click element travel-clear-button
wait 900
clip end routine_box

# ── Closure ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
mark closure
clip closure
cursor hide
hold 15
clip end closure
state
quit
